WEBVTT

00:00.720 --> 00:03.520
♪Shrugging off past burdens♪

00:03.520 --> 00:06.110
♪Beneath the mask, who am I?♪

00:06.780 --> 00:10.180
♪Release and find wider shores♪

00:11.880 --> 00:14.890
♪Love's a riddle, and rain pours heavy♪

00:15.260 --> 00:17.790
♪Crossed paths, now downward fall♪

00:18.130 --> 00:21.570
♪From dust arises starlight's spark♪

00:23.320 --> 00:28.540
♪Tearing through
the night's dense blockade♪

00:29.220 --> 00:34.300
♪Heart's flame illuminates all solitude♪

00:35.100 --> 00:37.590
♪Let time's sails drift endlessly♪

00:37.590 --> 00:40.200
♪Through wandering exile♪

00:40.720 --> 00:47.980
♪Breaking free from the cocoon,
I start anew♪

00:48.950 --> 00:51.710
♪Moon as song, life as flame♪

00:51.770 --> 00:54.610
♪Nameless heart clings fiercely♪

00:54.900 --> 00:55.930
♪Let me♪

00:56.120 --> 01:00.200
♪Charge toward the next raging river♪

01:00.650 --> 01:03.330
♪Moon darts, snow falls♪

01:03.620 --> 01:06.320
♪We tread rugged paths to reunite♪

01:06.490 --> 01:07.960
♪Hands held tight♪

01:07.960 --> 01:12.130
♪We forever live for love's sake♪

01:12.490 --> 01:22.740
♪Shadow's spear burns fiercely♪

01:24.170 --> 01:29.720
=Legend of The Female General=

01:29.920 --> 01:32.830
=Episode 29=

01:37.450 --> 01:38.300
Right.

01:39.090 --> 01:40.410
Now that we're in the capital,

01:41.970 --> 01:44.450
it's do or die.

01:45.630 --> 01:49.090
(Yuzun Pavilion)

02:00.130 --> 02:01.120
Mr. He.

02:04.970 --> 02:05.920
You're here.

02:06.370 --> 02:07.210
Mr. Chu.

02:07.210 --> 02:08.060
What a coincidence.

02:10.169 --> 02:11.690
Is this a gift for someone?

02:12.490 --> 02:13.410
Exactly.

02:13.410 --> 02:14.890
I'm staying at the Xiao Mansion.

02:15.210 --> 02:16.250
This is for Mr. Xiao

02:16.250 --> 02:17.150
and his wife.

02:17.490 --> 02:18.329
(This person)

02:18.329 --> 02:19.530
(looks very familiar.)

02:24.530 --> 02:26.210
(She resembles the woman
in the painting.)

02:29.630 --> 02:31.410
Mr. Chu, who is this lady?

02:32.610 --> 02:33.570
Well...

02:33.970 --> 02:34.850
Who are you?

02:35.290 --> 02:36.290
Are you close with Zilan?

02:38.010 --> 02:38.880
I'm He Yan,

02:39.130 --> 02:40.130
a friend of Mr. Chu.

02:43.690 --> 02:44.610
Mr. Chu,

02:44.610 --> 02:45.450
I'll take my leave.

02:46.329 --> 02:47.300
See you.

02:53.810 --> 02:56.260
(Ganming Pavilion)

02:59.090 --> 03:00.250
Yuzun Pavilion, right?

03:01.130 --> 03:02.110
Let's go.

03:04.830 --> 03:08.770
(Yuzun Pavilion)

03:09.330 --> 03:10.170
(It seems)

03:10.610 --> 03:12.170
(Chu Zhao is interested)

03:12.250 --> 03:13.450
(in He Yan.)

03:14.490 --> 03:15.650
(I wonder)

03:15.930 --> 03:17.570
(how Miss Xu will react)

03:17.730 --> 03:18.930
(when she finds out?)

03:19.030 --> 03:20.960
(Xu Mansion)

03:27.770 --> 03:28.670
Miss Xu.

03:33.490 --> 03:34.690
You seem

03:34.850 --> 03:35.890
upset.

03:37.930 --> 03:39.010
What's it to you?

03:41.210 --> 03:42.850
Have you heard the story

03:43.170 --> 03:45.130
about the female general of Jiyang?

03:47.370 --> 03:48.850
Female general of Jiyang?

03:50.110 --> 03:51.050
Never mind.

03:51.050 --> 03:52.050
You showed such

03:52.210 --> 03:53.810
refreshing honesty earlier.

03:53.950 --> 03:55.350
Had you taken up sword and service,

03:55.350 --> 03:56.190
history would

03:56.190 --> 03:58.090
remember you as renowned
as that female general.

03:59.050 --> 04:00.370
Haven't you heard, Miss Xu?

04:00.530 --> 04:01.850
The female general He Yan

04:01.970 --> 04:03.170
achieved remarkable feats

04:03.290 --> 04:04.250
in the battle of Jiyang,

04:04.410 --> 04:05.330
defending the city.

04:05.650 --> 04:07.210
She is a role model for women.

04:07.610 --> 04:10.010
By the way,
she's just returned to Yaojing.

04:11.170 --> 04:12.130
He Yan?

04:16.930 --> 04:17.920
Mr. He.

04:19.290 --> 04:20.160
You're here.

04:20.529 --> 04:21.690
What a coincidence, Mr. Chu.

04:22.530 --> 04:23.530
He Yan

04:24.330 --> 04:25.250
is actually a woman?

04:25.380 --> 04:26.370
Correct.

04:26.370 --> 04:28.170
She's a good female general.

04:28.510 --> 04:29.450
I hear

04:29.450 --> 04:30.650
that even Mr. Chu

04:30.770 --> 04:32.530
holds her in high regard.

04:33.340 --> 04:34.250
Though

04:34.250 --> 04:35.170
whispers of her serving

04:35.170 --> 04:36.190
in the army cross-dressed

04:36.570 --> 04:38.130
have reached the common folk,

04:38.490 --> 04:40.370
it remains unknown to His Majesty.

04:40.730 --> 04:41.850
His Majesty even made her

04:42.290 --> 04:43.330
Attendant Wu'an.

04:44.450 --> 04:45.370
Who knows

04:45.370 --> 04:46.370
what will happen

04:46.450 --> 04:47.530
to He Yan

04:47.850 --> 04:48.730
if His Majesty

04:48.970 --> 04:50.090
discovers the truth?

04:54.530 --> 04:55.650
Naturally,

04:56.090 --> 04:57.970
it's a capital offense.

05:07.320 --> 05:08.260
Hey!

05:08.810 --> 05:09.890
Are you zoning out?

05:18.080 --> 05:19.050
General Yan.

05:19.050 --> 05:20.890
I am glad to see you.

05:21.210 --> 05:22.130
Please.

05:22.130 --> 05:23.140
Sit and drink with me.

05:33.409 --> 05:34.970
You treat He Yan quite specially.

05:35.810 --> 05:36.850
I came to see you,

05:37.090 --> 05:38.530
yet you didn't even pour me liquor?

05:39.170 --> 05:40.130
You have hands.

05:40.250 --> 05:41.210
I do have hands.

05:41.210 --> 05:42.240
But he doesn't?

05:52.490 --> 05:53.340
It's chilly.

05:55.250 --> 05:56.170
I'll fetch you a coat.

06:01.810 --> 06:02.770
I'm just saying.

06:03.530 --> 06:04.800
Why did he take it seriously?

06:05.610 --> 06:06.610
Actually,

06:06.610 --> 06:07.460
all these years,

06:07.970 --> 06:09.330
he's only shown concerns

06:09.370 --> 06:10.340
about He Rufei.

06:10.660 --> 06:11.570
But now,

06:11.570 --> 06:12.530
he cares about you too.

06:13.540 --> 06:14.450
You seem

06:14.450 --> 06:16.050
slightly better than He Rufei.

06:16.370 --> 06:17.890
But don't go doing the things he did.

06:18.650 --> 06:20.610
He cares about He Rufei?

06:21.810 --> 06:23.090
You might not believe this.

06:23.730 --> 06:24.730
Xiao Jue

06:24.730 --> 06:26.530
painstakingly taught General Feihong

06:26.810 --> 06:28.210
Qinglang Sword Style

06:28.250 --> 06:29.280
day after day.

06:29.610 --> 06:30.770
How is that possible?

06:31.090 --> 06:32.010
Why wouldn't it be?

06:32.450 --> 06:33.490
I saw it with my own eyes.

06:43.730 --> 06:44.850
No, like this?

07:07.250 --> 07:08.210
Xiao Jue,

07:08.210 --> 07:09.170
you're secretly standing

07:09.810 --> 07:10.890
outside He Rufei's room

07:11.650 --> 07:13.210
just to teach a fool swordsmanship?

07:13.450 --> 07:14.890
You secretly followed me

07:15.330 --> 07:16.250
just to watch me

07:16.250 --> 07:17.170
coach a fool?

07:17.370 --> 07:18.730
T-That's not the same.

07:19.250 --> 07:20.290
Have you lost your mind?

07:20.850 --> 07:21.970
Why waste time on a fool

07:22.010 --> 07:22.880
like him?

07:27.210 --> 07:28.410
Are you even listening to me?

07:28.690 --> 07:29.770
Why bother

07:29.770 --> 07:30.690
with a fool?

07:31.210 --> 07:32.770
I don't consider it a waste of time.

07:33.290 --> 07:34.810
You coach him daily,

07:35.010 --> 07:35.970
yet his progress

07:35.970 --> 07:37.130
is barely noticeable.

07:37.850 --> 07:39.250
He gets help from a top student,

07:39.490 --> 07:40.450
yet he remains mediocre.

07:41.250 --> 07:42.210
It's laughable.

07:43.170 --> 07:44.210
I'll go tell him right now

07:44.690 --> 07:45.890
that if he's got no talent,

07:46.250 --> 07:47.409
he shouldn't waste your time.

07:47.810 --> 07:48.740
Let's fight a duel.

07:51.730 --> 07:53.170
I once tried so hard to force him

07:53.650 --> 07:54.690
to accept my challenge.

07:54.690 --> 07:56.010
Yet he always refused.

07:56.530 --> 07:57.530
But he agreed

07:57.690 --> 07:58.570
because I promised

07:59.010 --> 08:00.610
to keep it a secret

08:01.050 --> 08:02.110
from the ingrate He Rufei.

08:02.770 --> 08:03.810
Can you believe it?

08:05.650 --> 08:07.130
Xiao Jue must be blind.

08:07.930 --> 08:09.290
Each one at Xianchang Academy

08:11.570 --> 08:12.530
is better than He Rufei,

08:12.610 --> 08:14.050
an ungrateful wretch.

08:37.169 --> 08:38.720
So that's how these

08:38.720 --> 08:40.289
Qinglang Sword Style techniques work.

08:42.370 --> 08:43.250
Who kindly

08:43.250 --> 08:44.850
left these notes to me?

08:49.570 --> 08:50.430
(Feet still. Reverse sword spin.
Sweep waist, thrust left)

08:54.620 --> 08:55.520
(Feet planted, turn left,
step right into bow stance)

09:07.290 --> 09:08.290
There's more.

09:09.490 --> 09:11.170
Once during archery class,

09:11.550 --> 09:12.810
He Rufei forgot his thumb ring.

09:12.810 --> 09:13.690
Xiao Jue

09:13.730 --> 09:14.810
gave his own spare

09:14.810 --> 09:15.730
(to He Rufei.)

09:18.890 --> 09:19.940
Where's my thumb ring?

09:49.770 --> 09:50.770
Size doesn't matter.

09:50.770 --> 09:51.650
Better than nothing.

09:55.130 --> 09:56.450
Are you even listening to me?

10:01.530 --> 10:02.690
What took Xiao Jue

10:03.250 --> 10:04.490
so long?

10:05.090 --> 10:06.090
Whatever.

10:06.090 --> 10:07.290
My wife is waiting for me.

10:07.890 --> 10:08.900
I'm leaving.

10:17.810 --> 10:19.050
So, that's how it was.

10:49.330 --> 10:51.210
What is inside?

11:05.930 --> 11:06.810
(You left a letter)

11:07.370 --> 11:08.210
and a pouch,

11:08.210 --> 11:09.210
and then disappeared.

11:10.290 --> 11:11.290
What's that about?

11:15.610 --> 11:16.510
What?

11:16.970 --> 11:18.130
You left something else?

11:19.090 --> 11:19.970
Nothing else.

11:45.450 --> 11:46.610
Yan He couldn't wait

11:47.130 --> 11:48.190
and left.

11:50.890 --> 11:51.810
It's okay.

11:55.290 --> 11:56.250
Put your cloak on.

12:02.810 --> 12:04.170
All these days,

12:06.010 --> 12:07.610
it's been like walking through darkness

12:08.890 --> 12:09.930
alone.

12:12.090 --> 12:13.690
No one noticed my existence.

12:15.410 --> 12:16.480
No one cared about

12:16.730 --> 12:18.010
my joys or sorrows.

12:19.890 --> 12:21.090
No cheers,

12:22.490 --> 12:23.690
and no apologies.

12:25.290 --> 12:26.570
Happiness or grief,

12:27.930 --> 12:29.370
beginnings or endings,

12:29.810 --> 12:31.410
it was a story about a lonely person.

12:37.610 --> 12:38.610
Until one day,

12:40.810 --> 12:42.050
someone saw me.

12:44.090 --> 12:45.330
(Back at Xianchang Academy,)

12:46.050 --> 12:47.840
(the one secretly
teaching me swordsmanship)

12:49.050 --> 12:49.950
was you.

12:51.250 --> 12:52.650
(The one who lent me a thumb ring)

12:54.770 --> 12:55.810
was also you.

12:56.450 --> 12:57.690
Why were you so kind to me?

12:58.970 --> 12:59.850
Back then,

13:01.530 --> 13:02.430
(I was timid)

13:03.410 --> 13:04.480
(and felt inferior.)

13:05.690 --> 13:07.050
(Nobody respected me.)

13:13.850 --> 13:15.010
To be honest,

13:16.530 --> 13:18.650
at first, I did look down on you.

13:20.050 --> 13:21.450
But you are so tenacious

13:21.970 --> 13:22.810
and stubborn.

13:24.130 --> 13:25.810
You never give up on yourself.

13:27.650 --> 13:28.770
Perhaps our situations

13:28.770 --> 13:29.690
are too similar.

13:30.970 --> 13:31.970
At such a young age,

13:33.170 --> 13:34.290
we chose

13:34.290 --> 13:35.610
to shoulder the family's burdens.

13:37.530 --> 13:38.370
My life

13:38.370 --> 13:39.330
was also once low-point.

13:40.370 --> 13:41.330
Sometimes,

13:42.570 --> 13:43.530
I felt helpless.

13:45.570 --> 13:46.850
That's why whenever I saw you

13:46.850 --> 13:47.690
practicing alone

13:48.170 --> 13:49.610
so hard,

13:52.170 --> 13:53.730
I saw myself reflected in you.

13:55.090 --> 13:56.330
I couldn't help but want

13:57.010 --> 13:57.890
to be kind to you.

13:59.370 --> 14:00.210
It felt like

14:02.290 --> 14:04.010
compensating for my younger self.

14:09.050 --> 14:09.950
Look.

14:10.970 --> 14:11.970
Tonight's moon

14:14.490 --> 14:15.330
is so beautiful.

14:40.010 --> 14:40.990
Are you

14:41.410 --> 14:42.810
returning this to me

14:43.250 --> 14:44.330
because it looks ugly?

14:55.370 --> 14:56.250
You noticed.

14:59.650 --> 15:01.090
It looks terrible.

15:10.090 --> 15:11.890
I wish to be like the bright moon,

15:12.170 --> 15:13.490
guarding you forever.

15:14.550 --> 15:15.960
(Rundu is in peril. I'm going to help.
I need your sword.)

15:19.570 --> 15:24.130
♪Walking through the crowd,
without asking about the future♪

15:25.650 --> 15:27.490
Every time Commander misunderstands me,

15:28.530 --> 15:29.690
it breaks my heart.

15:30.970 --> 15:32.130
Go on.

15:32.930 --> 15:33.970
You and I met

15:33.970 --> 15:35.170
in a former life.

15:39.850 --> 15:41.090
I was once a female general.

15:42.170 --> 15:43.140
I thought

15:43.370 --> 15:44.370
you'd say "I will be."

15:45.530 --> 15:46.530
The last secret.

15:50.930 --> 15:51.970
I love the moon.

15:52.730 --> 15:53.930
Yet the moon doesn't know.

15:54.940 --> 16:00.130
♪Just to tread the snow you described♪

16:03.250 --> 16:04.370
Do you still love the moon?

16:06.090 --> 16:07.140
Yes.

16:08.060 --> 16:14.530
♪It's hard to sever love or hatred♪

16:15.260 --> 16:21.540
♪Before fate is confirmed♪

16:22.340 --> 16:26.410
♪My love rests between your fingers♪

16:26.410 --> 16:27.460
Now,

16:29.050 --> 16:30.090
the moon belongs to you.

16:33.790 --> 16:35.850
You're the first one
I taught swordsmanship to.

16:37.850 --> 16:39.650
(You're the first one
I tended wounds to.)

16:41.500 --> 16:43.100
(You're the first one I gave candy to.)

16:45.210 --> 16:46.730
(You're the first one)

16:48.130 --> 16:49.090
(I bought clothes for.)

16:53.450 --> 16:54.970
You're the first girl

16:56.090 --> 16:57.090
I tried to comfort.

16:58.970 --> 17:00.610
(You're the first one)

17:01.850 --> 17:02.750
(I covered for.)

17:06.890 --> 17:07.930
Finally, I realize

17:10.329 --> 17:11.359
that in my life,

17:11.690 --> 17:13.089
the only person I love

17:16.290 --> 17:17.210
is you.

17:18.560 --> 17:24.800
♪Snow falls on windowsills,
moments fading away♪

17:25.859 --> 17:32.030
♪Before fate is confirmed♪

17:32.930 --> 17:38.620
♪My love for you burns fiercely♪

17:39.550 --> 17:43.100
♪Lifelong devotion turns into a vow♪

17:43.100 --> 17:46.300
♪That's my last wish♪

17:47.420 --> 17:53.280
♪Awaiting the spread of moonlight♪

18:01.290 --> 18:03.050
Since Xiao Jue and your sister

18:03.170 --> 18:05.490
already suspect you,

18:06.330 --> 18:08.530
they'll maintain high alert

18:09.090 --> 18:12.290
during the return to the capital.

18:12.490 --> 18:13.770
Our failure this time

18:14.330 --> 18:16.330
was expected.

18:17.650 --> 18:18.690
Chancellor.

18:18.690 --> 18:19.770
What's our next move?

18:20.100 --> 18:21.010
Perhaps

18:21.010 --> 18:22.650
we strike first

18:22.820 --> 18:24.030
before they meet His Majesty.

18:24.530 --> 18:26.210
Our earlier failure

18:26.890 --> 18:29.690
means we've lost the best chance.

18:30.370 --> 18:32.890
You must stay calm now.

18:33.770 --> 18:34.690
Currently,

18:35.330 --> 18:36.850
their biggest obstacle

18:37.090 --> 18:38.730
is a lack of evidence.

18:39.520 --> 18:40.490
So,

18:40.490 --> 18:42.930
you shouldn't act rashly,

18:43.130 --> 18:45.050
avoiding giving them leverage.

18:45.650 --> 18:47.530
I can't keep calm, Chancellor.

18:47.850 --> 18:49.130
They're coming to the capital

18:49.130 --> 18:50.010
to find evidence.

18:50.170 --> 18:51.570
Are we just doing nothing?

18:51.690 --> 18:53.810
There's a prerequisite

18:53.970 --> 18:55.970
that the evidence exists.

19:01.450 --> 19:02.650
Did you

19:04.490 --> 19:07.410
leave any trace of what we did?

19:08.450 --> 19:09.380
Chancellor.

19:10.450 --> 19:11.370
He Yan and I

19:11.650 --> 19:13.050
cannot coexist in this world.

19:13.450 --> 19:14.290
Therefore,

19:14.690 --> 19:15.970
since I worked with you,

19:16.330 --> 19:18.690
I've held nothing back from you.

19:46.530 --> 19:47.890
Tonight's Mid-Autumn banquet

19:49.170 --> 19:50.530
marks the beginning.

19:51.850 --> 19:52.830
I will

19:54.010 --> 19:55.730
settle things clearly

19:56.850 --> 19:58.570
with He Rufei.

20:19.170 --> 20:20.220
Huaijin.

20:20.730 --> 20:21.630
Are you ready?

20:22.090 --> 20:23.010
I've been waiting

20:24.170 --> 20:25.530
so long for this.

20:47.890 --> 20:48.730
I guess

20:49.210 --> 20:51.090
this must be

20:52.050 --> 20:53.210
He Rufei, the renowned

20:53.490 --> 20:54.530
General Feihong.

21:02.130 --> 21:03.330
I am He Yan,

21:04.330 --> 21:05.290
Attendant Wu'an.

21:11.370 --> 21:12.210
General Feihong,

21:12.210 --> 21:13.450
are you feeling unwell?

21:14.690 --> 21:16.370
You should stay at Yuhua Temple

21:16.410 --> 21:17.250
for your health.

21:17.610 --> 21:18.970
Its location is excellent.

21:19.410 --> 21:21.090
It's ideal for physical recuperation.

21:24.970 --> 21:26.730
You're just second-rate.

21:27.170 --> 21:28.130
I won't

21:28.130 --> 21:29.930
stoop to your level.

21:30.170 --> 21:31.050
Second-rate?

21:33.690 --> 21:34.690
His Majesty made He Yan

21:34.730 --> 21:35.770
Attendant Wu'an.

21:36.570 --> 21:37.890
Are you

21:38.690 --> 21:40.410
questioning His Majesty's judgment?

21:51.690 --> 21:52.890
Take it one step at a time.

21:53.060 --> 21:54.330
- Right?
- Sure.

21:54.330 --> 21:55.730
That makes sense.

22:00.970 --> 22:01.920
Huaijin.

22:02.250 --> 22:03.610
Why does Mr. Yang seem

22:04.090 --> 22:05.210
to hate you?

22:05.850 --> 22:06.930
Back in Chonghuai,

22:07.170 --> 22:08.650
I heard from Yang Mingzhi

22:08.770 --> 22:10.250
about your conflict with Mr. Yang.

22:11.410 --> 22:12.690
It puzzled me greatly back then.

22:13.010 --> 22:14.810
I've long heard

22:15.010 --> 22:16.530
that Mr. Yang, Minister of War,

22:17.010 --> 22:17.970
is upright

22:18.250 --> 22:19.330
and loyal to His Majesty.

22:19.690 --> 22:21.410
How could he ally with Xu Jingfu?

22:21.930 --> 22:23.010
Once in a morning meeting,

22:23.610 --> 22:24.850
Mr. Yang's aggressive stance

22:25.530 --> 22:26.770
incensed me.

22:27.610 --> 22:28.570
But upon reflection,

22:29.090 --> 22:30.090
I think he is

22:30.090 --> 22:31.200
excessively upright.

22:31.290 --> 22:32.290
He sees the world

22:32.450 --> 22:33.490
in black and white.

22:34.610 --> 22:35.460
So,

22:35.770 --> 22:36.770
Xu Jingfu

22:36.770 --> 22:37.730
used him

22:39.010 --> 22:40.210
as a pawn against others.

23:00.610 --> 23:01.770
Mr. Liu, cheers.

23:03.090 --> 23:04.250
Cheers.

23:04.450 --> 23:05.290
Let's drink.

23:05.410 --> 23:06.300
Let's drink.

23:10.250 --> 23:11.300
Let's drink.

23:24.510 --> 23:25.490
Drink.

23:25.490 --> 23:26.430
Drink.

23:43.770 --> 23:44.640
Drink.

23:46.620 --> 23:47.530
To you.

23:47.530 --> 23:48.510
To you.

23:55.770 --> 23:57.610
- Excellent.
- Excellent.

24:00.100 --> 24:01.050
Splendid.

24:01.050 --> 24:02.250
The dance was superb.

24:03.290 --> 24:04.650
Is Attendant Wu'an present?

24:14.690 --> 24:15.570
I, He Yan,

24:17.290 --> 24:18.930
pay respects, Your Majesty.

24:20.610 --> 24:21.600
Rise.

24:22.210 --> 24:23.260
Thank you, Your Majesty.

24:25.440 --> 24:26.410
Attendant Wu'an,

24:26.410 --> 24:27.410
you raided enemies

24:27.450 --> 24:28.530
at night,

24:28.650 --> 24:29.650
burned their granaries,

24:29.890 --> 24:30.730
and defeated Wutuo

24:30.730 --> 24:32.090
in Rundu.

24:32.410 --> 24:33.810
I've heard much about your feats.

24:34.090 --> 24:35.050
You are

24:35.730 --> 24:37.770
a capable young man.

24:38.810 --> 24:39.730
Thank you.

24:40.210 --> 24:41.450
The credit belongs to all.

24:42.370 --> 24:43.250
The victory in Rundu

24:43.490 --> 24:45.570
depended on civilians and soldiers.

24:46.010 --> 24:46.980
With the help

24:46.980 --> 24:48.350
of Commander Xiao and General Yan,

24:48.490 --> 24:49.890
we won.

24:50.450 --> 24:51.610
You're very humble.

24:52.410 --> 24:53.250
Good!

24:54.810 --> 24:55.840
Minister Xiao.

24:56.210 --> 24:58.010
You trained a good soldier.

25:03.410 --> 25:04.250
Thank you.

25:04.930 --> 25:06.850
I simply employed standard drills

25:06.890 --> 25:07.810
for military training.

25:08.610 --> 25:09.690
His achievements stem

25:10.490 --> 25:11.770
from exceptional dedication.

25:12.450 --> 25:13.330
He has

25:13.370 --> 25:14.210
worked so hard.

25:17.090 --> 25:18.080
Attendant Wu'an,

25:18.410 --> 25:19.450
I'm curious

25:19.850 --> 25:21.130
about one thing.

25:21.490 --> 25:23.090
Since you serve under Commander Xiao,

25:23.330 --> 25:24.570
why didn't you impersonate him,

25:24.570 --> 25:26.050
a man you know better,

25:26.330 --> 25:27.610
instead of General He?

25:28.450 --> 25:30.210
After all, General Fengyun

25:30.570 --> 25:31.450
is as famous as

25:31.450 --> 25:32.690
General Feihong.

25:38.690 --> 25:39.710
Your Majesty.

25:40.930 --> 25:43.290
If I pretend to be General Fengyun,

25:43.690 --> 25:44.530
my face will

25:44.690 --> 25:46.010
immediately give me away.

25:47.770 --> 25:49.130
But General Feihong

25:49.890 --> 25:51.810
always wore a mask in the past.

25:52.490 --> 25:54.010
Few have seen his true appearance.

25:54.930 --> 25:56.060
Thus, impersonating him

25:56.210 --> 25:57.930
is naturally easier.

25:58.730 --> 26:00.370
That's how I could

26:00.490 --> 26:02.130
leverage General Feihong's reputation

26:02.330 --> 26:03.410
to intimidate the Wutuo.

26:03.850 --> 26:04.970
That sounds reasonable.

26:06.010 --> 26:06.890
It seems

26:06.890 --> 26:07.810
I ignored details.

26:09.170 --> 26:10.050
Speaking of which,

26:10.330 --> 26:11.890
you should thank General He.

26:17.970 --> 26:18.940
Your Majesty.

26:19.770 --> 26:21.890
General He comes from a noble family.

26:22.050 --> 26:23.730
I don't dare to make a connection
with him.

26:24.450 --> 26:27.010
Nevertheless, I must indeed

26:27.410 --> 26:29.770
express my gratitude to General He.

26:36.050 --> 26:37.170
Thank you, General He.

26:38.210 --> 26:39.530
I am

26:40.610 --> 26:42.130
very grateful to you.

26:54.810 --> 26:55.780
Your Majesty.

26:56.410 --> 26:59.330
I hold General He in high esteem.

26:59.490 --> 27:01.410
Now that I've finally met him

27:01.770 --> 27:03.330
at this Mid-Autumn banquet,

27:03.730 --> 27:06.290
I wish to spar

27:06.610 --> 27:07.810
with General He

27:08.130 --> 27:09.970
to enliven the celebration for all.

27:10.450 --> 27:12.170
May Your Majesty grant my request.

27:19.530 --> 27:21.330
Challenge General Feihong?

27:21.610 --> 27:23.010
He is so overconfident!

27:23.090 --> 27:24.030
Exactly.

27:30.010 --> 27:32.090
His Majesty just praised your humility,

27:32.450 --> 27:33.650
and now you're getting cocky.

27:34.810 --> 27:36.410
A bad general

27:36.450 --> 27:37.650
makes a bad soldier.

27:38.850 --> 27:39.890
Mr. Yang,

27:39.890 --> 27:41.410
that's a little judgmental.

27:42.130 --> 27:44.210
To match General Feihong's prowess,

27:44.610 --> 27:46.130
I've practiced martial arts

27:46.290 --> 27:47.570
relentlessly.

27:57.570 --> 27:58.530
Your Majesty.

27:58.970 --> 27:59.930
This Mid-Autumn Festival

28:00.210 --> 28:02.050
is a time for peace and joy.

28:02.490 --> 28:03.370
A fight game

28:03.730 --> 28:05.410
seems inappropriate.

28:10.930 --> 28:12.030
General He.

28:12.510 --> 28:13.410
Attendant Wu'an

28:13.410 --> 28:14.690
is awaiting His Majesty's reply.

28:15.450 --> 28:16.690
Before His Majesty speaks,

28:17.570 --> 28:19.650
why did you rush to decline?

28:26.610 --> 28:27.650
Your Majesty.

28:29.410 --> 28:30.970
I think

28:31.130 --> 28:33.570
General He made a fair point.

28:33.930 --> 28:36.850
A fight before Your Majesty

28:37.250 --> 28:39.610
is indeed improper.

28:40.890 --> 28:42.210
It's just to add to the fun.

28:42.890 --> 28:43.850
When I

28:43.890 --> 28:44.890
was Crown Prince,

28:44.890 --> 28:46.090
I often sparred

28:46.530 --> 28:47.810
with soldiers.

28:49.330 --> 28:51.010
Both of you know what to do.

28:51.810 --> 28:53.490
Don't hurt each other.

28:53.890 --> 28:55.490
- As Your Majesty commands.
- As Your Majesty commands.

29:02.690 --> 29:03.780
Use this sword.

29:22.690 --> 29:23.610
The Qinglang Sword

29:23.610 --> 29:24.890
is General Feihong's sword.

29:25.570 --> 29:27.170
Why is Attendant Wu'an

29:27.570 --> 29:28.850
holding it?

29:29.330 --> 29:30.570
So strange.

29:31.210 --> 29:32.060
Attendant Wu'an.

29:32.530 --> 29:34.010
Why hesitate?

29:34.490 --> 29:35.450
If you fear losing,

29:35.810 --> 29:37.730
surrender now.

29:38.250 --> 29:40.170
Bring it on, General He.

30:15.770 --> 30:16.670
Incredible!

31:15.970 --> 31:17.290
General Feihong is defeated?

31:17.290 --> 31:18.970
How is this possible?

31:28.370 --> 31:29.660
It's so...

31:36.650 --> 31:37.650
Your Majesty.

31:37.650 --> 31:38.610
I'm done.

31:39.450 --> 31:40.480
Impressive.

31:46.850 --> 31:47.900
He Rufei.

31:48.130 --> 31:49.770
You wish me dead, right?

31:50.170 --> 31:51.210
I'll take your life

31:51.610 --> 31:52.730
like a vengeful ghost.

31:54.650 --> 31:55.550
He Yan!

31:57.370 --> 31:58.270
General He.

31:58.810 --> 31:59.730
Stop shouting here.

32:00.090 --> 32:01.170
You can't stand to lose?

32:04.810 --> 32:06.010
Your Majesty, forgive me.

32:06.010 --> 32:07.170
That's not true.

32:07.530 --> 32:08.450
I...

32:08.450 --> 32:09.380
I...

32:13.970 --> 32:15.040
Your Majesty.

32:15.970 --> 32:17.130
People say

32:17.250 --> 32:18.530
martial artists

32:18.730 --> 32:20.050
are all proud.

32:20.850 --> 32:23.010
General He's martial skills
are unmatched.

32:23.330 --> 32:25.410
If he hadn't been injured

32:25.570 --> 32:26.620
in the Huayuan Battle

32:26.850 --> 32:28.850
or had recovered,

32:29.330 --> 32:30.730
he never

32:31.090 --> 32:32.570
would've lost.

32:33.050 --> 32:35.650
General He is too young

32:36.050 --> 32:37.530
to accept this outcome.

32:37.770 --> 32:40.130
That's understandable.

32:40.490 --> 32:41.330
Actually,

32:41.890 --> 32:43.730
this outcome

32:44.010 --> 32:45.370
means little.

32:45.930 --> 32:48.810
So long as Your Majesty and officials

32:49.050 --> 32:50.410
find enjoyment,

32:51.010 --> 32:54.130
it would be great.

32:56.850 --> 32:57.920
Attendant Wu'an.

32:58.490 --> 32:59.610
At such a young age,

32:59.810 --> 33:01.450
you show remarkable courage and wisdom,

33:01.970 --> 33:02.890
making you

33:02.930 --> 33:04.530
a good soldier.

33:11.890 --> 33:13.690
- Congratulations, Your Majesty,
- Congratulations, Your Majesty,

33:14.170 --> 33:16.010
- on acquiring an exceptional soldier.
- on acquiring an exceptional soldier.

33:22.210 --> 33:26.650
The Empress came with noblewomen
to propose a toast.

33:35.920 --> 33:38.400
(Princess of Wei, Empress of Wei)

33:55.810 --> 33:57.250
- I wish Your Majesty
- I wish Father

33:57.570 --> 33:59.090
- happiness.
- happiness.

33:59.410 --> 34:01.930
- May Wei lasting peace!
- May Wei lasting peace!

34:02.690 --> 34:03.580
Rise.

34:04.170 --> 34:05.290
Thank you, Your Majesty.

34:17.409 --> 34:19.090
- We wish Your Majesty
- We wish Your Majesty

34:19.290 --> 34:21.010
- happiness.
- happiness.

34:21.210 --> 34:24.050
- May Wei lasting peace!
- May Wei lasting peace!

34:33.850 --> 34:34.730
Please sit.

34:47.290 --> 34:49.170
(She's a good female general.)

34:49.730 --> 34:51.530
(I hear that even Mr. Chu)

34:51.730 --> 34:53.530
(holds her in high regard.)

35:09.850 --> 35:10.850
Pingting.

35:11.530 --> 35:13.330
Mind your manners before His Majesty.

35:17.090 --> 35:18.110
Your Majesty,

35:18.570 --> 35:19.770
I have something to report.

35:23.650 --> 35:24.530
Your Majesty,

35:24.530 --> 35:25.530
I bring charges against

35:25.730 --> 35:26.770
He Yan of Yezhou Garrison.

35:32.530 --> 35:33.650
She disguised as a man

35:33.850 --> 35:35.690
to join the army.
She's been deceiving you.

35:35.970 --> 35:37.210
Please punish her severely.

35:38.180 --> 35:39.210
What?

35:39.210 --> 35:40.170
Disguised as a man?

35:42.330 --> 35:43.390
Is that true?

35:44.890 --> 35:46.530
What? He Yan is female?

35:47.610 --> 35:48.770
This is deception.

35:48.770 --> 35:49.650
Exactly!

35:49.650 --> 35:51.570
This is deception!

35:51.770 --> 35:52.830
Yes.

35:53.010 --> 35:53.930
How's this possible?

35:54.930 --> 35:55.810
Who knows?

35:56.090 --> 35:56.930
Impossible.

35:58.450 --> 35:59.450
It's a capital offense.

36:00.970 --> 36:02.010
It's insane.

36:03.730 --> 36:04.770
Miss Xu,

36:05.690 --> 36:06.770
before His Majesty,

36:06.770 --> 36:07.740
mind your words.

36:08.450 --> 36:09.310
Attendant Wu'an

36:09.770 --> 36:10.970
couldn't possibly be female.

36:17.330 --> 36:18.180
Your Majesty,

36:18.730 --> 36:20.210
a body check will confirm

36:20.450 --> 36:21.370
my honesty.

36:23.570 --> 36:24.690
I just don't know

36:25.170 --> 36:26.330
if she dares to do that.

36:28.170 --> 36:29.090
Good idea.

36:30.020 --> 36:30.890
Do a body check.

36:30.890 --> 36:31.780
- Yes.
- Yes.

36:33.730 --> 36:34.650
Minister Xiao.

36:34.650 --> 36:35.810
In your opinion,

36:36.010 --> 36:37.410
how should I handle this?

36:45.010 --> 36:46.050
Your Majesty,

36:46.250 --> 36:47.230
I'm sorry

36:47.810 --> 36:49.050
for bothering you.

36:58.410 --> 36:59.300
Actually,

37:00.010 --> 37:01.210
I've long been aware of this.

37:01.970 --> 37:02.980
What?

37:03.490 --> 37:05.010
Your Majesty knew it?

37:05.570 --> 37:06.620
So, that's true.

37:11.780 --> 37:12.690
Yes.

37:12.690 --> 37:13.760
Well...

37:14.610 --> 37:15.580
(When I was young,)

37:15.930 --> 37:16.930
I met a woman

37:17.130 --> 37:18.210
by chance.

37:19.210 --> 37:20.220
To be honest,

37:20.570 --> 37:21.650
she has no talent

37:22.690 --> 37:24.010
for martial arts.

37:25.450 --> 37:26.490
Back then, I thought

37:26.570 --> 37:28.010
she was rather foolishly persistent,

37:28.930 --> 37:29.930
and she would give up

37:30.570 --> 37:31.890
after encountering some setbacks.

37:34.530 --> 37:35.450
But to my surprise,

37:36.530 --> 37:37.810
she persisted day after day

37:38.610 --> 37:40.330
and did it.

37:41.650 --> 37:42.850
I've never seen

37:43.250 --> 37:45.010
such unyielding determination in anyone.

37:45.970 --> 37:47.210
She is like a steadfast tree

37:48.610 --> 37:50.010
and as resilient as grass.

37:52.250 --> 37:53.690
She commanded my attention.

37:56.050 --> 37:56.960
Actually,

37:57.290 --> 37:58.330
back then,

37:58.330 --> 37:59.890
I didn't know how I felt about her.

38:00.410 --> 38:02.650
I was a little too harsh on her,

38:03.650 --> 38:05.130
giving her a strict teaching.

38:07.610 --> 38:08.540
I guess

38:08.890 --> 38:11.250
she must've hated me.

38:13.810 --> 38:14.690
Well,

38:15.970 --> 38:18.130
no wonder you remain solitary.

38:19.330 --> 38:21.090
You frightened the girl away.

38:22.730 --> 38:24.210
She didn't flee from my harshness.

38:25.090 --> 38:26.080
However,

38:26.210 --> 38:27.490
misfortune struck her family.

38:29.290 --> 38:30.140
From then on,

38:31.330 --> 38:32.690
we were separated by distance

38:34.090 --> 38:35.050
and out of touch.

38:38.650 --> 38:39.810
Surprisingly, we met again

38:41.770 --> 38:43.170
in Yezhou.

38:44.250 --> 38:45.330
She was in trouble

38:46.090 --> 38:47.050
and helpless.

38:48.290 --> 38:49.220
However,

38:50.500 --> 38:51.370
she

38:51.370 --> 38:52.490
remained indomitable

38:53.810 --> 38:54.930
yet naive.

38:56.850 --> 38:58.370
This reminded me vividly

38:59.010 --> 39:00.250
of our childhood friendship.

39:01.290 --> 39:02.530
Childhood friendship?

39:03.930 --> 39:04.850
I don't think so.

39:06.050 --> 39:07.250
You finally realized

39:07.850 --> 39:08.690
you had feelings

39:09.610 --> 39:10.730
for that girl, right?

39:23.450 --> 39:24.450
You are right.

39:26.130 --> 39:27.050
After our separation,

39:27.210 --> 39:28.090
I came to realize

39:30.090 --> 39:31.330
that my feelings for her

39:33.170 --> 39:34.930
couldn't be forgotten.

39:45.650 --> 39:46.560
Your Majesty.

39:46.890 --> 39:48.530
I admired her exceptional abilities

39:49.250 --> 39:50.570
and didn't want to part with her.

39:52.370 --> 39:53.770
So, I let her disguise as a man

39:54.250 --> 39:55.650
to stay at Yezhou Garrison.

39:57.850 --> 39:58.850
Your Majesty.

39:59.370 --> 40:00.770
I offer my two military merits

40:00.990 --> 40:01.930
to beg your forgiveness

40:01.930 --> 40:03.410
for my recklessness.

40:04.490 --> 40:05.570
I implore your approval.

40:15.170 --> 40:16.050
I granted the request

40:16.050 --> 40:17.450
of Commander Xiao.

40:17.930 --> 40:18.930
So, Attendant Wu'an

40:19.130 --> 40:20.450
commits no act of deception.

40:21.130 --> 40:22.090
Moreover,

40:22.090 --> 40:23.250
I'm moved

40:23.490 --> 40:25.130
by Commander Xiao's love.

40:25.650 --> 40:26.610
He is fully pardoned.

40:27.970 --> 40:30.010
- Your Majesty is wise.
- Your Majesty is wise.

40:34.970 --> 40:36.450
Your Majesty is merciful

40:36.890 --> 40:40.170
and forgives their deception.

40:40.610 --> 40:42.650
Yet General Fengyun,

40:42.930 --> 40:45.050
as military commander,

40:45.330 --> 40:47.650
deceived us all

40:47.730 --> 40:49.290
for personal reasons.

40:49.450 --> 40:52.130
It may

40:52.370 --> 40:53.850
disappoint the troops.

40:54.450 --> 40:55.930
That makes sense.

40:56.530 --> 40:57.370
If soldiers

40:57.370 --> 40:58.210
start following

40:58.210 --> 40:59.330
this example

41:00.330 --> 41:01.810
and hide women in camp,

41:02.690 --> 41:03.730
military order

41:03.730 --> 41:04.650
will be ruined.

41:06.690 --> 41:08.850
♪Light shines upon my heart♪

41:08.960 --> 41:12.880
♪Unveiling scars,
I choose to swim upstream♪

41:13.050 --> 41:15.000
♪The resonance of courage
rings loud and clear♪

41:15.090 --> 41:20.020
♪It's the boldness
that defines existence♪

41:32.110 --> 41:33.520
♪I've seen the mountains♪

41:33.720 --> 41:35.140
♪And trodden through ice♪

41:35.400 --> 41:38.220
♪Day after day, I venture alone♪

41:38.530 --> 41:39.920
♪Destiny is my creed♪

41:39.980 --> 41:41.380
♪Ideals surge beneath the surface♪

41:41.520 --> 41:43.320
♪Igniting the flame against the winds♪

41:44.520 --> 41:45.990
♪A restless yearning in my soul♪

41:46.160 --> 41:47.450
♪Gazing through the mire♪

41:47.620 --> 41:50.020
♪Who cares about this boundless void♪

41:50.210 --> 41:52.260
♪Charge ahead with blazing fervor♪

41:53.400 --> 41:55.230
♪Stubbornly fighting with my life♪

41:57.190 --> 42:00.110
♪Soaring across the world's expanse♪

42:00.200 --> 42:02.860
♪There must always be a longing♪

42:03.310 --> 42:08.380
♪Disregard the wounds to seek the light♪

42:08.710 --> 42:10.720
♪Light shines upon my heart♪

42:11.030 --> 42:14.680
♪Unveiling scars,
I choose to swim upstream♪

42:14.910 --> 42:16.810
♪The resonance of courage
rings loud and clear♪

42:16.840 --> 42:20.680
♪It's the boldness
that defines existence♪

42:21.040 --> 42:22.980
♪Chasing the light within my heart♪

42:23.160 --> 42:26.980
♪Burying frailty,
embracing life through death♪

42:27.240 --> 42:32.990
♪You'll meet gazes where storms brew♪

42:33.880 --> 42:39.350
♪With our unwavering true love,
brave the world with me♪

